  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 21, 2026 at 08:11 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/maharashtra+fda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Maharashtra FDA</a> has issued a statewide compliance order for <a href=\"/tag/health+supplements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">health supplements</a>, <a href=\"/tag/nutraceuticals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nutraceuticals</a>, food for special dietary use, food for special medical purpose, prebiotic and probiotic food and novel food.The order mandates stricter <a href=\"/tag/regulatory+oversight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">regulatory oversight</a> and is applicable with immediate effect to manufacturers, brand owners, importers, distributors, warehouses, retailers, pharmacies, gymnasiums, hospital suppliers and e-commerce entities, FDA said in a statement.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>At present the state has 1,100 operative food business licences under the health supplement and nutraceutical categories, covering 313 manufacturers, 759 relabellers and 28 repackers.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>It directed businesses across the supply chain to comply with existing licensing and product approval requirements.It also warned against disease-cure claims, representations such as “recommended by doctors” and misleading advertisements by influencers and on social media.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>In further action against popular supplements, the FDA announced targeted scrutiny for undeclared steroids and drug substances in sports-nutrition, weight-loss, sexual-wellness and herbal products.The move follows a statewide search drive conducted on November 13, during which the FDA inspected 17 establishments across six divisions and seized stock worth Rs 1.39 crore.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Samples of the seized products have been sent to the laboratory for analysis, the FDA added.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                  